  // SilentSiteDetector_Service enumerates ConnectionStrings whose key matches
  // ApplicationDb_<int> at runtime, scans each tenant DB for silent sites,
  // and emails per-site. No additional config required for the multi-tenant
  // detector — it picks up new tenants automatically when their connection
  // string is added below.

  // SMTP for sync-failure and silent-site alert emails sent from Email_Service.
  // If From or Host is missing/empty, Email_Service logs a skip-message and
  // returns gracefully — no crash. Username/Password are optional (anonymous
  // relays are supported). Port defaults to 587 if unset or non-numeric.
  // SecureSocketOptions is currently hardcoded to StartTls.
